{
  "_help": [
    "One entry per Roboflow Universe dataset. Copy workspace / project / version from the dataset URL:",
    "https://universe.roboflow.com/<workspace>/<project>/dataset/<version>",
    "format: 'coco' or 'yolov8' for object detection (each leaf box is cut out as its own photo), 'folder' for classification.",
    "class_map: Roboflow class name -> our label (configs/classes.json). Classes not listed are skipped.",
    "Map leaves of plants we don't support (pepper, potato, grape, ...) to other_plant: they teach the plant head.",
    "Don't map diseases we don't support on our crops (e.g. tomato mosaic) to anything: leave them out.",
    "Run with --list-classes first to see the dataset's exact class names, then fix class_map.",
    "Set enabled to true when an entry is filled in."
  ],
